Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Shrouded in Smoke of Gunpowder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 14
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, do you remember which rift leads to Green Green Grassland?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Intuition tells me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you’ve chose a wrong way again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one must be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When will it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So hot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are fur dolls also afraid of heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strong wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sand—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a familiar plot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only wait for the sandstorm to disappear before going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go back quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,where is it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandstorms changed the terrain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t just walk around, we have to look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,rift rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So tired
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so thirsty. Where can I find water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,leave the water
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Zhou, Xiao Ze,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and Xiao Ju, the super group appears
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling so awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,attack with love
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender and give us your water and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to leave safely
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I’m going to punish you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,they are in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I go to help
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s really nothing I can do against you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want to resist me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it again, hand over all the water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing my goods is tantamount to offending
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care who you are, it’s my territory
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can disobey me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,let them go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it just a little boy and a stuffed toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t look down on stuffed toys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit my men? I’ll show you what I’m capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually fighting with wool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That doll can still talk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you both for your help. We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just our car
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the repair issues to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,fixed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re so wasteful
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you drink water with so much sand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The most precious thing in this Blue Planet world is water. Don’t pick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You go everywhere as transporters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a purple rift?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the water. Let us take our leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t have water or a vehicle. It’s very dangerous to walk in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not go to the town and get ready before setting off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise we will fall in the desert before we can find the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don’t know how to get to the town either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to transport supplies back and we’re on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As a thank you, I’ll send you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we would rather obey than be respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll find out when you go to the town
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry sorry sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,this is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, we’re going into town
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,big sale big sale
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The new flying saucer will win prizes if you hit it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Out-of-print toys available with water
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just complete the exchange’s bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You can exchange them for corresponding water, food, and other supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The higher the bounty, the more materials you can redeem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go trade
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to leave beforehand
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s reward order No. 37
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can exchange it for food and weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Water, water, I want water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it turns out to be exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, let’s go redeem it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can redeem food, weapons and water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,water we need water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes three robbers to exchange for a bottle of water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re obviously outsiders. The low reward
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is just because the robbers you caught were too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any rewards for more water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The highest reward currently is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The robber known as Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So far no one has been able to catch them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,why
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Their whereabouts are mysterious
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is that they are very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any tasks that are simpler and more rewarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then choose this one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks like Tibbie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she do that warrants such a high reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,she is lost
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father is eager to find his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and set a generous reward
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you drink our water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Information is a commodity. That’s the rule here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is really dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The water we finally exchanged for it was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find rifts in the desert
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the orders we can do are far too meager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If only a wanted person could just come to me on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, if you catch her, you can change the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,she is Tib—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter if she looks like Tibbie, take her back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, she would be captured by other bad guys while running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,hello
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,doll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t mean any harm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad is looking for you. We’re just here to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not my father
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They were just talking nonsense to catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t go with you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, when will you get rid of your habit of lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your relationship with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m her dad’s driver
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to transporting supplies on weekdays,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I help find traces of Miss Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for the kindness of you two, I wouldn’t be able to catch her today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,lie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you bad guys
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, do you think he looks familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you a robber on the reward order?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
